A||N||55||85SE||Fiero On A Pole - caution, large pics||||14||
Z||000000||85SE||08-15-2001||06:40 PM||||Hey everyone:<P>If anyone reads the fiero.org e-mail list, you might remember a discussion back in April about the Fiero on a pole that someone had found on the web.  I offered to take some digital pics when I got home from Toronto, as I recognized it as the Flying Fiero from a local auto customizing business.  Well, I figured it was about time I posted the pics somewhere - after all, I took them in April when there was still snow on the ground!<P>Anyhow, it's a Standard I coupe; can't tell you which year because the car is up too far to see the decklid and presence of a rear brake light.  Figure on it being an '84 though - those are by far, far the most common Fieros here in Newfoundland.  I don't know if the folks with the shop are Fiero folks or not as I sold my car and have no reason to go to such a shop  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>I have higher res/size pics - e-mail me if you'd like them.<P>The entire innards of the car are gone - even the wheels are mounted to hubs that are welded to some mild steel under the car.  The rims - I don't think these are Fiero rims; they looked more like something I'd see on a 5.0 Mustang or something.<P>If anyone wants to call them, add a 1-709 to the number on the sign!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroPole1_small.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroPole2_small.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroPole3_small.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroPole4_small.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroPole5_small.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>Andrew Menchions - 85SE - AKA Fieroless in Newfoundland||||reg||14
Z||000001||KRMFiero||08-15-2001||07:34 PM||||haha that must of been interesting to see....||||reg||1
Z||000002||Songman||08-15-2001||08:31 PM||||Looks like the wheels on my T-top.. <P>That's pretty cool. Reminds me of a junkyard down close to Ed Park's place that has an old Chevy pickup on a stick.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
