Z||000019||85SE||08-16-2001||12:28 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fierokid87:<BR><B>Looks like they cut out the frame and welded the car to that sign post.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Scott, if you look at the pics, you'll see that the car is actually bolted to the stands - but it depends on you having a bright view of the pics:0  I was talking to one of the guys who made it last year (before it was put up, so he was sort of hush-hush about it) and he told me that they were gutting as much as possible from the car but keeping the bare essentials.  As to how much that is, I don't know.<P>Cheers - Andrew||||reg||7
